{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36661","headline":"广陵秋夜读进士常修三篇因题 · 罗隐","name":"广陵秋夜读进士常修三篇因题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入蜀归吴三首诗，藏於笥箧重於师。\n劒关夜读相如听，瓜步秋吟炀帝悲。\n景物也知输健笔，时情谁不许高枝。\n明年二月春风里，江岛闲人慰所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36661.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36661","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}